WEBVTT

00:20:28.796 --> 00:20:30.196
RW: One way to think about it

00:20:30.236 --> 00:20:33.236
is not whether the relationship
is smooth all the time,

00:20:33.276 --> 00:20:37.436
but whether we feel
that we can be authentic,

00:20:37.476 --> 00:20:40.996
we can be ourselves in a relationship.

00:20:40.996 --> 00:20:43.996
And obviously, we won't be the same selves

00:20:44.036 --> 00:20:49.356
in a work relationship that we might be
with our, you know, beloved sister,

00:20:49.396 --> 00:20:50.956
you know.

00:20:50.956 --> 00:20:56.396
But still, can I be myself
in the most essential ways?

00:20:56.436 --> 00:20:57.956
Can I express myself?

00:20:57.996 --> 00:21:00.916
And can the other person
express themselves?